      "message": "test(goldens): judge the slot, trace and plasma goldens by their gates\n\nFive of the six posted goldens #862 left in UNJUDGED are now run\nthrough the gate their kind's post runs (tests/posted_gates/):\nthe two slot goldens and trochoid_slot_small through verify in\nMode::Area against the stadium operation::region_of builds for a real\nSlot / TrochoidalSlot op; trace_plate_with_hole through verify in\nMode::Engrave against the plate's section as region_of builds it for\na Trace op; plasma_plate_with_holes through the plasma laws\n(verify::plasma::judge), as the plasma post clause runs them. Each\nprogram is proved byte-identical to its CL golden first. All five\nverify clean - no golden moved, none was regenerated.\n\nthe_slot_gate_bites shows the harness convicts a slot program judged\nagainst a narrower stadium. The posted-golden guard now counts the\nblocking findings of all three gate families. arc_planes stays in\nUNJUDGED with a precise reason (a hand-built posting fixture no op,\npart or region makes); the gap is #1093.\n\nFixes #1000\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
